  Approved implementation and verification
    Removed diagnostic scenario 9's six rows without renumbering surviving scenario IDs,
    cleaned its test-local alpha/reason branches, and removed only budget TIR rows (1,true)
    and (2,true). That batch retained 120 primary cases: 66 diagnostic, 30 budget and
    24 unchanged continuity cases. Every remaining assertion, motion sample and fixture is
    preserved; no production or shader source changed.
    Debug and Release each passed 116/116 focused cases, zero failures/skips: all 66 retained
    diagnostics, four remaining exhaustion/TIR rows, 31 filter rows, six reduction cases and
    nine actual production TIR variants. Discovery proves the exact eight-row removal with
    no unexpected omissions/additions. Both configurations retain identical diagnostic IDs
    and all 96 logged pixel observations compared with the preceding 72-row reference.
    The other 26 budget cases and all 24 continuity cases reuse their unchanged source/kernel
